<section id="share"><h2>Same signature, every format</h2><p class="rule">Only public, approved derivatives belong in production share cards. These static templates contain no user IDs, originals, prices, proof of payment or fabricated live ownership. Creator identity lives in the central panel; the platform mark remains in the header.</p><div class="cards">${formats.map(({ id, width, height, channel }) => `<figure class="${height > width ? 'portrait' : ''}"><img src="assets/share-${id}.svg" alt="${channel} share template design specimen"><figcaption>${channel} · ${width} × ${height} · <a href="assets/share-${id}.svg" download>SVG</a> / <a href="assets/share-${id}.png" download>PNG</a></figcaption></figure>`).join('')}</div></section>
